ns/ec959a6d-b263-4b18-8548-482936cca8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=010765e3429424a94ccbeafc58b14c6a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aa8941d2/uploads/origins/ec959a6d-b263-4b18-8548-482936cca8d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb8399e2f7ed1f1a2f2f917f3fba7c79 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お世話になっております。\n\n以前ミニイラストを企画で描いていただいた漆紫狐々と申します。\n\nぜひともまたミニイラストを描いて頂きたいと思いリクエストさせていただきました。\n\nTwitter:@koko_urushi\n\n構図など完全におまかせでお願いしたいです！背景透過もいただけると幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f71786c5/uploads/origins/13213c70-0c05-48d7-80a4-597342b6d5d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5738391cd65bec251763af7df9fd3d65", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f71786c5/uploads/origins/13213c70-0c05-48d7-80a4-597342b6d5d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5738391cd65bec251763af7df9fd3d65, https://si.imgix.net/f71786c5/uploads/origins/13213c70-0c05-48d7-80a4-597342b6d5d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=283e47b989c7c4303c0de5e1842ed840 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f71786c5/uploads/origins/13213c70-0c05-48d7-80a4-597342b6d5d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=001c9e2fa0b3004a172054ab2b12b41c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先日アナログ絵をご依頼させて頂いた者です。\n可愛いステッカーと名刺のおまけまでありがとうございました。本当に嬉しかったです。\n実は以前デザインしていただいた「おもい」というアイドルが彼女とお友達なので、ステッカーのSDキャラと同じ絵柄のおもいをお願いしたいです。\n衣装は二人が一緒に写っている絵の方でお願い致します。\n配信者さん等ではなく拡散力がなく申し訳ないのですが、5年前からずっとNIA様の絵が大好きです。単色で緻密な線も、ミニマルで可愛らしい絵も両方大好きです。\n金額は、ささやかですがステッカーと日頃素敵な絵を無料で見せて頂いているお礼です。\n金銭的に余裕ができたらいつか個展などに足を運びたいと思っております。\n微力ながらこれからも応援しています。\nどうかお身体にお気を付けてお過ごしください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-W25-DfYoGzdoIABco0r6itI35U5yllN\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-W25-DfYoGzdoIABco0r6itI35U5yllN", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80c6e4da/uploads/origins/e1d89f9f-3417-4143-b06e-6591b948789a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc26bbf2c44c492b5df6d968098f8158", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80c6e4da/uploads/origins/e1d89f9f-3417-4143-b06e-6591b948789a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc26bbf2c44c492b5df6d968098f8158, https://si.imgix.net/80c6e4da/uploads/origins/e1d89f9f-3417-4143-b06e-6591b948789a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=344af80ca6923fc71e2ae3a48ecaa021 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80c6e4da/uploads/origins/e1d89f9f-3417-4143-b06e-6591b948789a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f663b723433f8c3105a7df571dbb67b4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "スケブのリクエスト送るのが初めてなので不慣れで申し訳ないです、\n添付したリンクからおそらく見れるかな、と思うのですが\nうちの子を描いてもらいたいです!!\n\nイラストのイメージはぽわぽわと少し眠そうな表情やポーズでお願いしたいです!\n細かなところはおまかせします..!\nよろしくお願いします!\n(イラストはあまりたれ目じゃないですが、たれ目っぽく描いて貰えると嬉しいです)\n\nNIAさんの描く曲線や動きのあるイラストが本当に大好きです、これからも応援しています!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ge11fFe8ag5ep7Y8XQiMY-2m_Ix9IhZb/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/065e4ffe/uploads/origins/39c8c685-d5c0-45ba-ba74-49222d63aa5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=00e58ba21356d7b0f108be00f33368fc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/065e4ffe/uploads/origins/39c8c685-d5c0-45ba-ba74-49222d63aa5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=00e58ba21356d7b0f108be00f33368fc, https://si.imgix.net/065e4ffe/uploads/origins/39c8c685-d5c0-45ba-ba74-49222d63aa5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ac79ee6b692230c0868b18f2bfba3bd9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/065e4ffe/uploads/origins/39c8c685-d5c0-45ba-ba74-49222d63aa5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b6c4f9134ccc3a38c2798ff9c9c79a21 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d65d9d2/uploads/origins/b13ad910-e662-47f1-8d4e-f884c5a9e25c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d04a15e6f93de3e4f27ebc6ef874d9a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d65d9d2/uploads/origins/b13ad910-e662-47f1-8d4e-f884c5a9e25c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d04a15e6f93de3e4f27ebc6ef874d9a, https://si.imgix.net/9d65d9d2/uploads/origins/b13ad910-e662-47f1-8d4e-f884c5a9e25c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25502e11d72f46dd3730ef7ee9ae9312 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d65d9d2/uploads/origins/b13ad910-e662-47f1-8d4e-f884c5a9e25c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe20a25f9f022b9a20336b974db4d087 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "We would like you to draw three idol units of original characters.\n\nUnit theme: dolls, idols, machines\n\nFirst (center): Inochi\nBlack, long hair to waist level, bangs are thin, just over the eyes, slicked back to the left side, with a princess cut.\nEyes: Vivid red, pinched, large, with long eyelashes.\nCostume: Gothic Lolita, black and red, Western doll image.\nPersonality: Bright, loves cute things, smiles a lot, best friends with Mariya\n\nSecond: Mariya\nHair: White, bob cut just below the shoulders, see-through bangs to just below the eyebrows, hair on the sides of the bangs not hanging over the ears\nEyes: Sky-blue, slanted, with long lower lashes.\nShe has a mole on the right side of her mouth.\nCostume: A white and light blue version of Inochi's costume, with the image of an angel (I want to incorporate wings somewhere).\nPersonality: Calm and natural, objective to everyone, good friend of Inochi and Inochi\n\nThird: Omoi\nHair: Gray, up to the chest area, inwardly curled in layers, M-shaped bangs, crossed in the middle, layered cut around the face.\nEyes: Saturated purple with glazed eyes and long lower lashes.\nCostume: A gray and purple version of Inochi's costume, with an androgynous image.\nPersonality: A little twisted and quiet, she has a distorted desire for her best friend, like faith.\n\nI love Meisuke-sama's sense of style, so I would like to leave the costume design, colors, composition, etc. to her.\nI apologize for the length of this essay.\nIf it is possible, I would appreciate it very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1aba1cdd/uploads/origins/fe80c710-b5bc-48d1-9df2-3c8e41beb503?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b5481f00375bf642890d9ed7e5b86cd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1aba1cdd/uploads/origins/fe80c710-b5bc-48d1-9df2-3c8e41beb503?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b5481f00375bf642890d9ed7e5b86cd, https://si.imgix.net/1aba1cdd/uploads/origins/fe80c710-b5bc-48d1-9df2-3c8e41beb503?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b665490aee2b551e81ed69c68da674c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1aba1cdd/uploads/origins/fe80c710-b5bc-48d1-9df2-3c8e41beb503?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40c4d24d3e79ffbd4fd4095700215126 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really like your SD character art. I'd like to request one of my character, Nep.\nHe is a wolf boy with a flirty personality. I would like him to be smiling and have a confident pose.\nPlease include a version with a transparent background. Thank you.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1U3T9_ejShQbm9b2DY4E5e4B-Yv5EKEYG/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1U3T9_ejShQbm9b2DY4E5e4B-Yv5EKEYG/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nia5710/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/672f47e0/uploads/origins/c8a6184b-0296-4113-bd7a-8a954df4d53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34e8b62c5537d9c3cedaefde90ed4ed9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/672f47e0/uploads/origins/c8a6184b-0296-4113-bd7a-8a954df4d53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34e8b62c5537d9c3cedaefde90ed4ed9, https://si.imgix.net/672f47e0/uploads/origins/c8a6184b-0296-4113-bd7a-8a954df4d53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=354b8fbbd4624d6ecf84127353bed2a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/672f47e0/uploads/origins/c8a6184b-0296-4113-bd7a-8a954df4d53c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b567c89e595ea1281cdb6bd11f9e82b7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It is nice to meet you!\nI love your illustrations and would love to have you as my illustrator.\n\nI would like to have a one-picture illustration and a two-headed miniature character!\n\nOne-picture\nI would like you to draw a figure lying down as shown in the sample. I want to make it a Cheki-style image, so please draw it in 3:4 size.\nI like the hands that Mr. Niai draws, so I would be happy if you could draw her lying down with her cheekbones on her head. Please make it a grinning expression. A window in the background would be nice (a simple outline of light only would be fine).\n\nMini-Character\nI would like the character in the reference image to be a two-headed mini character.\nPlease make the pose similar to the reference image.\nThe character should have a smiling expression with an open mouth.\nIt would be nice if the background is transparent.\n\nThat's all. I have always loved Mr. Niai's illustrations, so I am very happy to be able to work with him.\nI would like to use your illustrations in my app IRIAM, as well as in my header and icons.\n\nIf your illustration does not meet our requirements, you can cancel your order.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5qcI6pntjC6I_jnfXBEvXScSIitc0S2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}